### GET Invoices

GET {{base_url}}/invoices/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET Invoices

GET {{base_url}}/invoices/?from_issue_date=2026-05-01&to_issue_date=2026-05-31 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET Invoices

GET {{base_url}}/invoices/24/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### POST Invoices

